// ==========================================================================
// Touchpoints
// Model folder: 02 - Funnel / 2.2 - KPI
// --------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Purpose: Interactions across a journey.
// Why it exists: The denominator behind average touch count, which drives
// attribution model fit.
